<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5330] During the initialization process of the log thread, the SparkEnv is empty, which leads to failure</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5330</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a null pointer exception in the yarn application log file:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13053518/13053518_image-2022-12-05-16-26-36-021.png&quot; height=&quot;163&quot; width=&quot;897&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;root cause&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When SparkEnv has not been initialized, the log thread executes the SparkEnv.get operation first, causing NPE problems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;fix design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When SparkEnv.get is executed, it will cause a null pointer exception. If SparkEnv cannot be obtained, the new org.apache.hadoop.conf.Configuration object will be used.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
